================================================================================
Sample projects and print photographs — contributor-supplied assets
================================================================================

The editable project JSONs, 3MF print models, and photographs under `samples/`
were supplied by Will Cobb for this repository. `samples/source-files.json`
records their source files and published hashes. Project copies have descriptive
names and omit unused shapes and undo history. Recovered projects were checked
against their printed meshes. Editable distances and angles are rounded to tenths
at the contributor's request; traced outlines retain their original precision.
The 3MF files are unmodified copies of the supplied print exports.

The photographs in the sample directories' `photos/` folders are copies of the supplied
originals, cropped, rotated, and resized with ordinary pixel-processing tools. Embedded
metadata was removed. No generative image editing was used for these sample
photographs; the supplied originals remain unchanged.

These sample assets are distributed under Pocketry's AGPL-3.0-only licence.
Product names and marks retain their respective ownership.

