================================================================================
OpenCV / OpenCV.js — Apache License 2.0
================================================================================

Copyright (c) 2000-2024, OpenCV team and contributors.

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, the full text of which is
available at http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Pocketry redistributes an OpenCV.js bundle at
`client/public/opencv/opencv.js`, built from unmodified OpenCV 4.11.0
sources with the stock JS module whitelist (which includes the aruco API in
`objdetect`) — see `scripts/build-opencv-js.sh`.

Pocketry also pins a small amount of OpenCV-generated data: 28 custom
4x4 marker patterns used by calibration-sheet v2 and the object measurement aids
(`client/src/lib/calibrate/aruco-4x4.ts`). They are the deterministic output of
OpenCV 4.11.0's `extendDictionary(28, 4)` (preserving the original 8-, 16- and
22-marker prefixes) and remain under the same Apache
License 2.0 attribution.

